R-AP34 R-AP82 R-DA9 R-TP2 R-YK1 (slice 249): the write is sent again after 429, 503 and no answer: the waits are the Retry-After of the first answer (7 s), then 8 s and 30 s (the schedule, no header). The 4th request gets 200. The OIDC token is fetched once. Run 2: a DELETE gets 502, waits 2 s (the first step of the schedule), and the second gets 200. `sleep` is a call of the fake Fx.
